<title>HONG KONG: Shenyin says rights issue oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Shenyin says rights issue oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial services group Shenyin Wanguo (H.K.) Ltd said on Friday its rights issue was 255.5 percent subscribed.</p>
<p>The rights issue offered one new share for every two existing shares held at HK$1.00 per rights share. Warrants will be issued in the proportion of four warrants for every 10 rights shares held.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
